Package: adlSISE
Title: Predictive Linear Discriminant Analysis with R6 Classes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mounir", "Bekkar", , "mounirbekkar23@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Meroua", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Implements predictive linear discriminant analysis as an R6
    class. Qualitative predictors are recoded into dummy variables. The
    package computes classification functions, Wilks' lambda with Rao's F
    and Bartlett's chi-squared tests, per-variable F tests, forward and
    backward stepwise variable selection, stratified cross-validation and
    the confusion matrix.
